## Why This Is Asked

Tests mastery of CSS Grid, container queries, and accessible animations in a realistic dashboard.

## Key Concepts

- CSS Grid layout with responsive columns
- grid-auto-rows and minmax for variable heights
- container-type and @container queries to adjust density
- CSS animations for reveal; prefers-reduced-motion
- Accessibility: keyboard navigation and ARIA considerations

## Code Example

```css
.grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); grid-auto-rows: minmax(var(--row,120px), auto); grid-auto-flow: dense; container-type: inline-size; }
.grid > .item { border:1px solid #ccc; }
.grid input { display:none; }
.grid .panel { max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition: max-height .25s ease; }
.grid input:checked ~ .panel { max-height: 400px; }
@media (max-width: 1024px){ .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
@container (min-width: 60rem){ .grid { gap: 16px; } }
```

